WEBVTT

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:30.405
I found in my research that concern
for others is a critical ingredient

00:12:30.429 --> 00:12:31.943
for effective authenticity.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.646
This is guideline number two:

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:38.393
authenticity without empathy is selfish.

00:12:39.845 --> 00:12:42.704
I often hear people explain
their actions by saying,

00:12:42.728 --> 00:12:45.296
"Well, I was just being myself."

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:48.596
That's not an excuse
for disrespectful behavior.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.686
Sure, we should be true to our values,

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.646
but we might want to consider
others' values, too.

00:12:54.444 --> 00:12:56.726
Or as David Sedaris puts it:

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.783
(Recording) David Sedaris: Be yourself,
unless your self is an asshole.